{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-planner/1/manifest.json",
    "title": "知识规划角色清单",
    "summary": "声明 knowledge-planner 角色版本、提示与内联技能、输出合同、无工具策略、会话隔离和预算上限；属于配置事实，实际执行与强制校验仍需运行时证据。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "role_artifacts",
        "title": "角色与产物绑定",
        "body": "清单声明角色为 `knowledge-planner` 版本 1，使用 `traex` profile，并加载 `prompt.md`。[[c1]] 它还以内联模式绑定带摘要指纹的 `omem-knowledge-planner` 技能，并指定输出合同为 `KnowledgePlan.v1`，体现角色资产与结构化结果之间的配置关联。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "isolation_budget",
        "title": "隔离、工具与预算",
        "body": "工具策略被声明为 `none`，允许工具列表为空；会话不复用，也不继承用户技能或 MCP。[[c3]] 这意在让规划过程只依赖提供的目录上下文，减少外部状态影响。预算上限为 96,000 个上下文 token、24,000 个输出 token，并允许最多两次修复。[[c4]] 这些是清单中的期望约束，材料没有证明运行时已逐项执行。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "知识规划角色基本配置",
        "reason": "支持角色标识、版本、profile 和提示模板的配置事实。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-planner/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 2,
          "endLine": 8
        },
        "quote": "  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"role_id\": \"knowledge-planner\",\n  \"role_version\": \"1\",\n  \"profile_ref\": \"traex\",\n  \"prompt_templates\": [\n    \"prompt.md\"\n  ],"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "内联技能与输出合同",
        "reason": "支持技能的加载方式、摘要绑定以及 KnowledgePlan.v1 输出声明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-planner/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 9,
          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "  \"skill_bundles\": [\n    {\n      \"canonical_name\": \"omem-knowledge-planner\",\n      \"version\": \"1\",\n      \"load_mode\": \"inline\",\n      \"artifact_digest\": \"c3856cb51f7e47e53a96251712922dd2dc041fc6317cc0803fc96037d6e8e4d9\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"output_schema\": \"KnowledgePlan.v1\","
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "工具和会话隔离策略",
        "reason": "支持无工具、会话不复用且不继承用户扩展能力的配置。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-planner/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 18,
          "endLine": 26
        },
        "quote": "  \"tool_policy\": {\n    \"mode\": \"none\",\n    \"allowed_tools\": []\n  },\n  \"session_policy\": {\n    \"reuse\": \"never\",\n    \"inherit_user_skills\": false,\n    \"inherit_user_mcp\": false\n  },"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "知识规划预算",
        "reason": "支持上下文、输出及修复次数的具体配置上限。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-planner/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 27,
          "endLine": 30
        },
        "quote": "  \"budget\": {\n    \"max_context_tokens\": 96000,\n    \"max_output_tokens\": 24000,\n    \"max_repair_attempts\": 2"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "运行时是否验证内联技能摘要、强制禁用工具与继承，并对 KnowledgePlan.v1 失败结果执行至多两次修复？",
        "why": "manifest 只声明策略和预算，没有执行日志、宿主实现或测试来证明摘要不匹配、越权工具调用及 schema 失败时的实际行为。",
        "nextStep": "核对角色加载器、会话创建器、输出验证与修复循环的实现，并补充覆盖拒绝和重试上限的行为测试。",
        "blocking": false,
